{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日に引き続き\n本日は横浜にて個別握手会でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"忘れないうちに写真を貼っておきます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2015/09/13/5193446/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シャツワンピースはBORNY"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう秋ですね...\n私、秋は花粉がヒドく\nすでに始まりつつあるので今から\nビクビクしております(´-ω-`)ふぃ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2015/09/13/5193446/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪色〜！前髪切って〜！\nとか言われたりしたけど...\nもうしばらくはこの感じでいようかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"満足して、飽きてきたら...\nまた変えるから♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まなつ！\nまいやん！\nりんご！\nはぴば♡！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"りんご！\nみりあ！\n早く元気に戻ってこーい☆！！！"}],"source":"archive"}